  "titulo": "Para (not por) for unequal comparisons: for a...",
  "subtitulo": "Para ser niño, es muy maduro.",
  "foto": "t04.jpg",
  "regla": "Use para (not por) to compare something with what's expected of its kind: Para ser adolescente, es muy responsable (for a teenager). Often para ser + noun / adjective, or para + noun.",
